  "title": "BWXT Begins NRC Engagement on Licensing for a New Defense Nuclear Fuel Facility",
  "summary": "ERWIN, Tenn. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 7, 2026-- BWX Technologies, Inc. (NYSE: BWXT) announced today that it has notified the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) of its plan to apply for a uranium enrichment license for a new facility to be built adjacent to its Nuclear Fuel Services ( NFS)",
